#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:3
msgid "Minify font declarations with PostCSS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:5
msgid ""
"This module will try to minimise the `font-family`, `font-weight` and "
"`font` shorthand properties; it can unquote font families where "
"necessary, detect & remove duplicates, and cut short a declaration after "
"it finds a keyword. For more examples, see the [tests](test)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:32
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:34
msgid "minifyFontValues([options])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:36
msgid "options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:38
msgid "removeAfterKeyword"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:40
msgid "Type: `boolean` Default: `false`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:43
msgid ""
"Pass `true` to remove font families after the module encounters a font "
"keyword, for example `sans-serif`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:46
msgid "removeDuplicates"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:48
#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:55
msgid "Type: `boolean` Default: `true`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:51
msgid "Pass `false` to disable the module from removing duplicated font families."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:53
msgid "removeQuotes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/postcss-minify-font-values_README.md:58
msgid ""
"Pass `false` to disable the module from removing quotes from font "
"families. Note that oftentimes, this is a *safe optimisation* & is done "
"safely. For more details, see [Mathias Bynens' article][mathias]."
msgstr ""

